00:02:15.229 --> 00:02:22.030
There are a number of different reasons, but they generally break down into these. The first one

20
00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:30.270
is it is a more controllable transition. Now we're in a behavior tree. You've noticed that we

21
00:02:30.270 --> 00:02:38.830
have to stop people going down certain paths, and it needs to evaluate the entire behavior tree

